\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Data flow diagram for GGL90 package within a single MITgcm time step. The main model provides velocity, density gradient, and surface forcing to GGL90. GGL90 computes TKE, mixing length, and eddy coefficients, then returns the eddy coefficients to the momentum and tracer solvers via interface routines. TKE is the only prognostic variable, carried between time steps (dashed red arrow).}}{90}{figure.caption.15}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:ggl90_dataflow}{{2}{90}{Data flow diagram for GGL90 package within a single MITgcm time step. The main model provides velocity, density gradient, and surface forcing to GGL90. GGL90 computes TKE, mixing length, and eddy coefficients, then returns the eddy coefficients to the momentum and tracer solvers via interface routines. TKE is the only prognostic variable, carried between time steps (dashed red arrow)}{figure.caption.15}{}}
